{
  "5": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:92e03d50d37ba3acdf89fab351bc5e4e07461ea52348e66ae2454b8a2a650cf6",
      "text": "Iores. Sales are important.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:873dd04bb0068112bd7f103a77783dd3ca664475a9126a4c317fc9827063dcfb",
      "text": "No matter how much my surroundings\nor standard of living change, I never\nwant to forget what 1G is worth...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d30744fa3b5cd18580262590181a430bbf5f86a99b2b102a61364a42cf794411",
      "text": "...I'm not short on money. Why go\nfrom one food shop to another that's\njust like it—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e208e5ab0d52fa6201a7a2b5f23629fefd11fb05665ed14d579259408be9064d",
      "text": "They're not the same! The first\nshop and the last one have totally\ndifferent seasonings, and the meat—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5c5486f405933d5e5f2caf6f62eb14c62682bca14e398a1964c85f7652830459",
      "text": "What a pain of a man...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "26": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fc2bfa10dc6be388fb2f06ae2297b39043fc5b4a0ba87ef3a7d50865588805c3",
      "text": "You keep him company in my place\nfor once. As an ordinary citizen.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "30": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9e503abbc31d291fc1c3527ee55c909629b770c7fd43c5c2db659cf155d4332a",
      "text": "...But even though you say it's a\npain, you really do listen, huh?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "35": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c02c4d869e83fd16854a2988937876a620ce7fc17a8ed9850dc8ebc22b21d4c1",
      "text": "...I don't know what might give\nme something to think about.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "38": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:caae36a2ba23ae090db1d9bf383a570368fde71ad7093ce67aae4454815d75f6",
      "text": "Becoming an ordinary citizen\nmeans thinking about a lot of\nthings.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fa22bec0a1869fefef8cc39e7ea9f80c8902ab26f87b3284bb3b68c59c1ed0a0",
      "text": "The answer may be somewhere in what\nyou say. So I try to listen.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "45": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:09acc4e29f97244394d1548d40d2cd61e37eb5329704bb12f87b00878c84f233",
      "text": "Uh, huh...? I see...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "50": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:42ab0e61d87a5853acda6998eb79d3dbdbb8c3fd72b8bc5d5c345b6f5b8d446b",
      "text": "Well, sure looks like there's still\nplenty of trouble ahead. ...You've\nnoticed, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "55": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a3b9c6cc4a00c0bc3830421859f25a78325fc0bbdc9fc6993510c281f106e430",
      "text": "...No problem.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "57": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5fa030c8e1e6c9c24e9394e2b615078a117ad6622b7b3787dfa27b059945fa87",
      "text": "I'll just deal with it, as an\nordinary citizen.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "61": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ff10806f04f0f0c89c7af6e770e7caaa9011547841d18e7162ba32e67a126614",
      "text": "—Been a while, \"Hollow.\"",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "64": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:da2bcb22ddb44a3234c301cfaa76bda071f7c68e76a4bac52fb38f1a26775461",
      "text": "...I no longer need that name. And\nI've no intention of going back—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "67": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4e80526d1b4cbadb186ff90230ef68c05305ea906ccb3c52305d2b9019883b17",
      "text": "Hollow, team up with me.\nWe'll build a new organization.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "70": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d61a6c85a0c57798d99fcbff033264e78110ff85a16b521fd0d1c49f2b5f5ca6",
      "text": "...New?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "73": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c25ad50b4640dee10fa585db6389f8ad15f06c970be3e9237f577080845164de",
      "text": "The Farlands are on the brink of\nupheaval. With the underworld in\nchaos, now's our chance.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "74": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3c90dc6575525af1c4a4e4bd0ceecfd3021490fdd01f39283b66c071b9e1ab60",
      "text": "No need to be bound to the old nest\nanymore. We'll move the pieces. We'll\nbe the ones who bind.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "77": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:29cd6b1c7f5763ee3200569723881520a8ec33dc24be736b6a2d357be92e1140",
      "text": "...At a time like this. I'm\nsupposed to apologize first, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:39c4d66dd8d2583a2cf3e97c828e2f7415c8ece9cdb03c1cedc59f6c84215bba",
      "text": "Sorry, but I have no interest at\nall. I'm going to be one of this\ntown's people—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ce9caee0bcaab68524428a49d8fa699e2b75a55fc4ff078dd716b198d9807679",
      "text": "You, a hollow shell? You think you\ncan become \"the same\" as them?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "84": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8e911cff984d31f7199dd1457b45977705f72764094413ca1eb1e43ae079d269",
      "text": "There is no light inside us. No\nmatter how you imitate them, the\nsame thing will never be born.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "85": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c40b9d5f359c8ac62f2e20ccfff626d42b44c28adeba9d5ddc14f92db63ef215",
      "text": "It's only blinding, and stifling.\n...You understand, don't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "88": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1c7c0942d5a163fa3bf0243938b33edd08a9899e305daa95db3db50f8e8ccffd",
      "text": ".........Yeah.\nYou're right about that.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "91": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3ef64639e7bf7210d004ec75dc56f2ad127d1c2c01f6b39012182d49c078657d",
      "text": "Why I want to give apples. The wish\nnot to kill. There's nothing like\nthat inside me—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "97": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:587f54cc18d2233a626bb9fe2a78f4b628e6dff46ff3066056c722c76762b272",
      "text": "Even so. It was a pain,\nbut I thought about it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:03daabb835d321775e9c8437fe3e8ae96781210e1accd1602ca9eb7e941a4b53",
      "text": "What it meant that the town welcomed\nme. Why they smiled. I kept thinking.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "102": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0ae2709654d11786ab4541fda895eaeda1e20adbba1ac4ed87673dbcb63c9e81",
      "text": "...What are you talking about...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "105": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b7fe5e740da608e6ec8abe9612260ccabde021756cf0b74f10feb314baefddca",
      "text": "Hey, maybe—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "107": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:333e3f1259696b4c5245d85ff211d5e87e32a9fb36b539b511c5a2b00c42ae26",
      "text": "Maybe I could become\nfriends with them?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "110": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a89e8b2c96630f2b3cc43e3ba98e18d2fe1adb6a8752e069432db2e9913d6ef5",
      "text": "...How revolting. I'll beat\nsome sense back into you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "113": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:395d9a0e6b354da73c36fc4ca43c2505716558cb477e79c0d761c25f2749ecf3",
      "text": "...Don't kill. Don't make a scene.\nBut I should deal with this fast...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "116": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:62054d9178107833a4acef2ec81a53c528fd50ea14f27d6e5afb9e737cd2b2d7",
      "text": "...Wouldn't hitting them be\nfaster after all?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "120": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:740167dd95eb1a0032175cad5634b4bb392853d98777168acbe3076abac7ccaf",
      "text": ".........\nIs that how ordinary citizens do it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "124": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1f4b7642d62b7ef1c56baa869494d0318ced72daa12784612eca87f1fbebbaca",
      "text": "Who knows? We're not exactly\nupstanding or squeaky clean.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f7e6d9ccd82a8bb3d73672e9a8bd0f4313044b3283501d22ed22504ac77287db",
      "text": "Ha, sorry. Truth is, we can't\nreally call ourselves ordinary\ncitizens either.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:488f19143eaf57cf66aa7f3c6db82ec951911e0fdb321ac43e73df55d43c79cc",
      "text": "..........\n...................\nNobody told me that...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "138": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1a064e67e70ec8a294b83d11487eee54f0ec2cdd9d94009bdd371d074bbf4042",
      "text": "But I'm glad we made it in time.\n...Or were we in the way?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "142": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:abdea1e746fcb31f9b9118df67c41d304638c40ceb2be9f03514d0d851b3032d",
      "text": "...It wasn't necessary. It was a\nproblem I could handle myself.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "145": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:732d8d45a76af6f176e51a92a0dfe42c0eecab14633331546cbab643f179af6e",
      "text": "But I see. You come anyway.\n............It's difficult............",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "150": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:057e7f35a8ad8eaa3045dff1c7c6798009f2c9e1a5b724fa498425232ef9e33a",
      "text": "So, what do we do with these guys?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "154": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a311bba4839d63b2a9dcf5bc174df19304a160f8d2e53b9a7cbf60542fee9c7a",
      "text": "We hand them to the Guild.\n...This may have been good timing.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "157": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dacc9464e556233759c6e2358d42fa8f2b806450ef57daa7fa52388582104ce1",
      "text": "I'll think about it some more. How\nto live in this town, my own way.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "163": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6d53e63ae9d22a207ce6f8a4957925a61f2da1e36c539192a999ad3973823824",
      "text": "Hmm hmm hmm~ hmm~♪\nNow, where should we start?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "166": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:797e9cd7476965afabd10fafac1f1b9c85c63e614d6d07d6e238ca68ed2c79e6",
      "text": "Quade Arsalet...! Why are you—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e820c862079cc0adc60c7c47a1d96b13bbac0ad7fc5278ced097dfa292c7ee08",
      "text": "...I didn't kill them.\nThat's fine, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "173": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ea02ff8f3d6f76f4fe6c6bf91f8b2d4669396da2cd81c5e5b5fedc90d011f2f5",
      "text": "Good enough for a bodyguard. ...But\nI'm surprised you took the job. I\nheard you hate orders and restraints.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "177": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:63f461ea401cee6f45539205b85db83c27218ee0dec85b1bc6deb5ae44c2b067",
      "text": "...I was told to make it a \"good\nrelationship.\" That I needn't be\nanyone's pawn.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "179": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8717ef09e470dd46ca76162dda4b50d83c60cebb203e722d26a7db7d15cf71ca",
      "text": "You make use of my skills and\ninformation. I'm off watch and live\nmore like a citizen. Not bad.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "183": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4ec1c58c8a020aaedf478333b3f1e9cfbfd3e078b49de716ff9a9b0d6bdb9e5d",
      "text": "Thanks to you, the investigation is\nmoving. Shady new groups out of the\nFarlands really are on the rise.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "187": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:49d49c2854be398ed6cc315feff3d2ffa0103930fa909c27f268799bca205b66",
      "text": "...And those new groups are likely\ntied to the Star Augurs you're\nchasing. Was that it?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "190": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:57a595e0cbef18256e31f217728cc64a5defc4210412bba091710319a03261ab",
      "text": "If so, busting them will be more\nof a pain. Will you still help?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "194": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:248f4445d878648ff36a0960574bc7e38c347a13bcd2343382b6894b8747c2f6",
      "text": "The ordinary citizens I know...\nsometimes take on a pain for the\nsake of what they choose.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "197": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e0a8dcb9282eed957e0607e2f42fcea8f6d5c310783f8dcab11b8c3550c0b236",
      "text": "Then this is fine.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "200": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:edd75d42bad236064e1b53c77650a3da3afe19e724b0cd34b4e8084f7a12add6",
      "text": "What?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "204": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:21d286696ba9af2dc9d2425a8cf04e22b22581a4c49e7e1400d20d005120d1d7",
      "text": "Nothing. Oh, and anything you learn\non this job stays secret. Play dumb\nlike a good citizen, won't you?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "208": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:047fb036355ce5ae394ec86752100f9eb9cc08594b364f636f6f1af8c285135f",
      "text": "..........What a pain...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
